SUMMARY:North Ward Farmers Market Harvest Festival & Trunk-or-Treat
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, October 22\, 2026 | 4:00 PM – 7:00 PM\nEl Patio de La Casa | 43 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ \nLa Casa de Don Pedro\, in partnership with the City of Newark\, Mayor Ras J. Baraka\, the Office of Violence Prevention and Trauma Recovery (OVPTR)\, and Brick City Peace Collective\, invites the entire community to celebrate the season at our North Ward Farmers Market Harvest Festival and Trunk-or-Treat event. \nThis free community event brings together the best of fall in one festive evening. Shop fresh\, affordable produce from local vendors\, connect with health and social service resources\, enjoy live music and entertainment\, and let the kids trick-or-treat safely from decorated trunks in a welcoming\, family-friendly environment. \nWhether you are stocking up on fresh fruits and vegetables\, looking for information about community programs\, or simply looking for a fun night out with your family\, there is something here for everyone. \nWhat to Expect:\nFresh produce and local vendors\, health resources and social services\, trunk-or-treat for kids\, giveaways\, music and entertainment\, and family fun for all ages. \nNJ SNAP\, EBT\, WIC\, and Senior Vouchers accepted. Parking is available at 305 Broad St. and 281 Broad St. \nThis event is free and open to all. Families are encouraged to bring the kids in costume. Come celebrate community\, connection\, and the harvest season with us.
URL:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/event/north-ward-farmers-market-harvest-festival-trunk-or-treat/
LOCATION:El Patio de La Casa\, 43 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ\, 07104\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/North-Ward-La-Casa-Trunk-or-Treat-Event-2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
