SUMMARY:Know the Signs: LCDP’s Family Success Center Hosts Domestic Violence Awareness Workshop
DESCRIPTION:October is Domestic Violence Awareness Month\, and La Casa de Don Pedro is responding with action. \nOn Wednesday\, October 28\, 2026\, La Casa de Don Pedro’s Family Success Center I\, in partnership with the New Jersey Department of Children and Families\, will host a Domestic Violence Awareness Workshop from 11:00 AM to 1:00 PM at 23 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ. \nThis two-hour workshop is designed to create a safe\, supportive space where community members can learn\, share\, and access resources that promote safety\, healing\, and support for victims and survivors of domestic violence. Whether you are personally affected\, supporting someone you care about\, or simply want to better understand how to help\, this workshop is for you. \nTopics covered include: \n\nUnderstanding the signs of abuse\nSafety planning for those in dangerous situations\nAccessing community resources available to survivors and families\nSupporting survivors through trauma and recovery\n\nDomestic violence affects families across every community\, often in silence. Events like this are part of LCDP’s commitment to breaking that silence and ensuring that every person in Newark knows they are not alone and that help is available. \nRegistration is required. Scan the QR code on the flyer or visit tinyurl.com/LaCasaFSCReg to secure your spot. \nLa Casa de Don Pedro’s Family Success Center I is located at 23 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ. This program is supported by the New Jersey Department of Children and Families.
URL:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/event/know-the-signs-lcdps-family-success-center-hosts-domestic-violence-awareness-workshop/
LOCATION:23 Broadway\, 23 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ\, 07104\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/FSC-I-Domestic-Violence-Flyer-2026-English.png
END:VEVENT
